WEBVTT

1
00:00.500 --> 00:06.000
Second half under way at Northgate.

2
00:06.500 --> 00:12.000
Rivermoor have made one change at the break.

3
00:12.500 --> 00:18.000
Okonjo takes it down the right touchline.

4
00:18.500 --> 00:24.000
Cleared, but only as far as the edge of the box.

5
00:24.500 --> 00:30.000
Two-one, and Northgate want a third.

6
00:30.500 --> 00:36.000
The away end has been singing for ten minutes.

7
00:36.500 --> 00:42.000
Vieira signals for the ball wide.

8
00:42.500 --> 00:48.000
Whitfield is up off the bench and warming.

9
00:48.500 --> 00:54.000
That is a free kick, and a good one to have.

10
00:54.500 --> 01:00.000
Sixty-eight minutes gone at the Arena.

11
01:00.500 --> 01:06.000
Rivermoor break, three on two.

12
01:06.500 --> 01:12.000
Saved, and the rebound is hacked away.

13
01:12.500 --> 01:18.000
Northgate have not dropped a point at home.

14
01:18.500 --> 01:24.000
Twenty-two minutes left, plus whatever is added.

15
01:24.500 --> 01:29.500
Still two-one, and this one is not finished.
